WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.267
It's a secret laboratory

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.203
that China doesn't want anyone to see.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.938
CNN is the first media outlet

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.239
to get this close

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.408
to where China actually built its spy

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:09.242
balloons.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:09.843
A military

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.878
helicopter is seen sitting inside

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.346
the facility's gates

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.215
dispelling any notion that the balloons

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:17.450
are not used for military purposes.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.352
Will Ripley was there and filed

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:22.422
this OUTFRONT investigation.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:24.391
Hundreds of miles

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.825
from Beijing, a place

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.961
China doesn't want you to see.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.430
CNN, the first international media

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.564
to come here

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.533
behind a sea of barbed wire

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.368
and security checkpoints.

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.137
The base of a blacklisted

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.805
balloon manufacturer,

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:41.341
one of six Chinese entities. The U.S.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.709
government sanctioned

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.944
after that suspected spy balloon

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:46.780
had just shot it,

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.580
shot down,

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.150
pulled up and sent to an FBI lab.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.919
Each piece providing more proof.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:53.420
The U.S.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.356
says this was no weather balloon

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:59.793
deflating denial after denial by Beijing.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:01.861
China's foreign

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.530
ministry calls the whole thing

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.397
an accident.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.331
The balloon,

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.801
an unmanned civilian air ship.

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:09.769
CNN's search for the truth

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.004
behind the balloon

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:11.805
took our team

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:13.039
from the Chinese capital

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.507
to Shanxi province,

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.010
about 300 miles southwest of Beijing.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.611
Days of digging

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.914
and geo location technology

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:22.916
took us down this road

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.785
to a place few outsiders have seen.

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.888
No international media has ever

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.423
come this close.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.858
What did we find

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.060
An active industrial complex

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.462
with possible ties

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.564
to the Chinese military's vast,

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.400
highly secretive aerospace program.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.035
Eagles Men,

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:45.171
Aviation Science and Technology, or MRC

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.040
blacklisted by the US

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.708
Commerce Department.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.710
CNN searched corporate records

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.279
suggesting Inmarsat has permits

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.648
to develop and manufacture products

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.684
for the Chinese military.

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:00.487
The first thing we notice a giant white

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.055
dome A closer

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.690
look shows the company logo.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:06.259
And I saw that hunger inside that dome.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.594
A lab

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:10.296
we dug up a 2017 Chinese state

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.498
media report

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:13.500
The report says this is where workers

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.334
test high

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.902
altitude balloons

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:18.404
like the one that flew over the U.S..

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.472
Our team spotted

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.741
two more massive structures.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.210
They look like giant tents

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.411
punctuate teams.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.045
Search of state

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:26.980
media archives

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.048
reveals their true purpose.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:31.651
Huge stealth hangars helping

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.187
military choppers evade detection

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.655
by prying eyes.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.924
CNN cameras also captured this

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:39.826
what seems to be an assault

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.594
helicopter on display.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:42.896
Diplomacy it.

00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:43.897
And listen to this.

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:45.932
That same state media report

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:48.601
never once does it mention meteorology.

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:51.037
It boasts the balloons can carry

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:53.039
multiple detectors.

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.707
Communications equipment

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.242
used for civilian

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.343
and military

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.412
surveillance and reconnaissance.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:00.947
CNN tried to get answers

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:03.116
from all six companies on the U.S.

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:04.117
blacklist.

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.586
No response from Inmarsat or the others.

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.955
They're not talking about the balloon.

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:11.057
But President Joe Biden is.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:12.892
I make no apologies

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.594
for taking down that balloon.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.596
A suspected spy balloon.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:18.798
We may never know for sure who made it.

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.301
China is sticking to its weather

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.468
balloon claim

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:25.171
dismissed by the Pentagon as nothing

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:26.706
but hot air.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.945
This facility is located in

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:33.112
the city of Shanghai.

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:34.480
And by Chinese standards,

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.682
it's relatively small, around

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:36.849
3 million people.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.718
But what makes this location

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:41.888
highly significant is that this factory

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:44.791
is very close to a very large Chinese

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:45.625
military base.

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:46.092
And, in fact,

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.661
when our team was flying into this city,

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:50.096
they were instructed by the air

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.965
crew to close the window

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:53.533
shades on the plane

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:54.667
because they didn't

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:55.969
want the passengers

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:57.003
looking out the window

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:57.837
or taking pictures

00:03:57.837 --> 00:03:59.539
of a sensitive military site.

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:02.008
Right next to this balloon factory Erin.

